## Root Cause
The code does not verify if a user is authenticated before accessing sensitive routes, which could lead to unauthorized access.

## Explanation
The patch adds an authentication check using `req.isAuthenticated()` to ensure that only authenticated users have access to sensitive routes. This prevents unauthenticated users from accessing protected resources, thus improving the application’s security.

